{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDExLS0yMDE1L01hbGVmaWNlbnQlMjAlMjgyMDE0JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Maleficent","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/ik8PugpL41s137RAWEGTAWu0dPo.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xjotE7aFdZ0D8aGriYjFOtDayct.jpg","description":"A beautiful, pure-hearted young woman, Maleficent has an idyllic life growing up in a peaceable forest kingdom, until one day when an invading army threatens the harmony of the land. She rises to be the land's fiercest protector, but she ultimately suffers a ruthless betrayal – an act that begins to turn her heart into stone. Bent on revenge, Maleficent faces an epic battle with the invading King's successor and, as a result, places a curse upon his newborn infant Aurora. As the child grows, Maleficent realizes that Aurora holds the key to peace in the kingdom – and to Maleficent's true happiness as well.\n\nRated PG · Released 28 May 2014 · United States of America · Language: English · 97 min\nStudio: Walt Disney Pictures, Roth Films\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2014","genres":["Fantasy","Adventure","Action","Family","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.1","imdb_id":"tt1587310","moviedb_id":102651,"tmdbId":102651,"runtime":"97 min","cast":["Angelina Jolie","Elle Fanning","Imelda Staunton","Sharlto Copley","Lesley Manville","Juno Temple","Sam Riley","Brenton Thwaites"],"director":["Robert Stromberg"],"writer":["Linda Woolverton"],"released":"2014-05-28T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Don't believe the fairy tale.","country":"United States of America","language":"English","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Robert Stromberg","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/wmg5MgMd3Kx9Tk7QQbV9GLg30yd.jpg"},{"name":"Angelina Jolie","character":"Maleficent","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/bXNxIKcJ5cNNW8QFrBPWcfTSu9x.jpg"},{"name":"Elle Fanning","character":"Aurora","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ucC5faqfE